<title>CHINA: Int'l Bank of Asia interim net up.</title>
<headline>Int'l Bank of Asia interim net up.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K cents)	 26.19  vs 23.33</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K cents)  8.00   vs 7.20</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			 195.34 vs 148.39</p>
<p>    Turnover		  929.79 vs 688.17</p>
<p>    Company name	    International Bank of Asia Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     Oct 14-17</p>
